  "body": "Proudly positioned within the highly sought-after Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College school zones, this rare two-dwelling opportunity presents an exceptional combination of multi-generational living, breathtaking sea views and exciting future potential. \r\n\r\nSet across a generous 1,002sqm (more or less) site, the property features two brick-and-tile residences, offering flexibility for extended families, savvy investors or those exploring future development possibilities (subject to Council approval).\r\n\r\n1/166 features two bedrooms and two bathrooms, complemented by open-plan lounge and dining areas, a separate kitchen and seamless flow onto the decking. Elevated to capture the ever-changing outlook across Eastern Beach, it offers a wonderful setting to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\n166 offers three bedrooms and three bathrooms, with spacious open-plan living extending onto wrap-around decking. Enjoy all-day sunshine and equally impressive beach views, creating a beautiful setting for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nBoth dwellings feature high ceilings throughout the living areas, low-maintenance brick construction beneath tiled roofs, spacious basement areas and separate laundries, adding further practicality and appeal.\r\n\r\nOccupying a substantial 1,002sqm Mixed Housing Suburban site, this is an opportunity to enjoy comfortable extended-family living today while exploring the potential to redevelop in the future (Subject to council approval). Whether you choose to accommodate multiple generations, generate additional rental income or investigate subdivision and redevelopment options, the possibilities are certainly worth exploring.\r\n\r\nLocation is another standout. Within walking distance of Bucklands Beach Primary and zoned for the highly regarded Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, the property also enjoys convenient beach access via the Clovelly Road Walkway.\r\n\r\nOpportunities combining two dwellings, substantial land, exceptional sea views and premium school zoning are seldom available. Secure this versatile coastal holding, enjoy the lifestyle it offers today and explore the possibilities for tomorrow.\r\n\r\nContact Team Tina today to discover the potential and make this exceptional opportunity yours!",
